<odoo>

    <template id="report_appraisal_letter_template">
        <t t-call="web.basic_layout">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <div class="page"
                     style="padding:40px;
                            font-size:14px;
                            font-family:Arial, sans-serif;">
                    <div style="text-align:center;">
                        <h2>
                            Appraisal and Promotion Letter
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <br/>
                    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:5px 0;">
                                <strong>Release Date:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="o.release_date"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:5px 0;">
                                <strong>Employee Name:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="o.employee_id.name"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding:5px 0;">
                                <strong>Employee Code:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="o.employee_code"/>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                    <br/>
                    <br/>
                    <p>
                        Dear
                        <strong>
                            <span t-esc="o.employee_id.name"/>
                        </strong>,
                    </p>
                    <p>Congratulations!</p>
                    <p style="text-align:justify; line-height:24px;">
                        We take this opportunity to congratulate you, and express our appreciation for your valuable contribution in achieving company objectives. 
                        We are confident that you will continue the good work in the same spirit of commitment and sincerity and grow with our organization.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                    Consequent to the review of your performance, we take great pleasure to inform you that as part of Performance appraisal, 
                    your salary structure has been revised with effect from <strong><span t-esc="o.effective_date"/></strong>. 
                    The details of your revised salary structure have been provided under Annexure- I of this letter
                    </p>
                    <p style="text-align:justify;line-height:24px;">
                        Additionally, you are promoted to <strong><span t-esc="o.promotion_job_id.name"/></strong>.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Please note that the content of this letter being personal and confidential should not be divulged with others.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        All other terms and conditions of your employment remain unchanged. 
                        We look forward to a mutually beneficial association and your active participation as a key contributor in BXITech’s journey towards our shared goals and a rewarding future ahead!
                    </p>
                    <br/>
                    <br/>
                    <br/>
                    <table style="width:100%;">
                        <tr>
                            <td style="width:50%;">
                                <strong> HR Department</strong>
                            </td>
                            <td style="width:50%;text-align:right;">
                                <strong>Employee Signature</strong>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>
</odoo>